   "text": "Gaussian blur, sigma 1 / 2 / 3\nmedian filter 5x5\nJPEG re-compression, quality 50 / 20 / 10\nbit depth 3 bits per channel\ndown-up resampling 0.5x then back\nOCR (EasyOCR) -> mask dilated 3 px -> Telea inpaint",
